: 220, "text": "Have fun, make the ground vibrate with a crash,"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "For nothing beats a good game of hit and play,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Swing your squash, to always have a blast!"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}